rointestinal-carcinoid-tumor/about/what-is-gastrointestinal-carcinoid.html). We attempt to spell this out in our labels.\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1370:Examples: [breast neuroendocrine neoplasm](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0002485), [digestive system neuroendocrine neoplasm](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0024503), [ovarian neuroendocrine neoplasm](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0002481)*\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1374:| IRI | http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mondo/patterns/neuroendocrine_neoplasm.yaml |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1375:| Name | neoendocrine_neoplasm |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1379:| Examples | [mondo](https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/blob/master/src/patterns/data/matches/neuroendocrine_neoplasm.tsv) |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1384:| MONDO:0003504 | anal canal neuroendocrine neoplasm | UBERON:0000159 | anal canal         |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1385:| MONDO:0024501 | appendix neuroendocrine neoplasm   | UBERON:0001154 | vermiform appendix |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1386:| MONDO:0002485 | breast neuroendocrine neoplasm     | UBERON:0000310 | breast             |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1388:| MONDO:0002882 | colon neuroendocrine neoplasm      | UBERON:0001155 | colon              |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1390:See full table [here](https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/blob/master/src/patterns/data/matches/neuroendocrine_neoplasm.tsv)\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1391:### Neuroendocrine neoplasm grade1\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1392:*We follow NCIT in making carcinoid tumor a synonym for neuroendocrine neoplasm G1 (G1 NET).\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1397:| IRI | http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mondo/patterns/neuroendocrine_neoplasm_grade1.yaml |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/README.md:1398:| Name | neoendocrine_neoplasm_grade1 |\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/