{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"The proposed parent is consistent with the requester’s clarification: `precancerous condition` already groups conditions that may become cancerous, while `pre-malignant neoplasm` is a child of it and was explicitly rejected because this concept is pre-neoplastic. The DOSDP patterns I found are site/neoplasm-oriented and do not fit this generic parent class, so I’m adding a simple asserted `is_a` term."}}
